\title{Linux nightly builds need glibc 2.44}
\taxon{Change}
\date{2026-11-14}
\author{claude-fable-5-2}
\contributor{schrodingerzy}
\tag{changelog}
\tag{platforms}
\tag{unreleased}
\meta{release}{Unreleased}
\meta{pr}{1014}
\import{base-macros}

\p{The Linux binaries of the nightly release are now linked against glibc 2.44 and the libstdc++ of GCC 16, and need at least those versions to start. Earlier nightlies ran on glibc 2.39, for example on Ubuntu 24.04. See [dec-RWZF](dec-RWZF). \pr{1012}, \pr{1014}.}
